WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:40.680 --> 01:41.850
Qi Yuan,

01:43.120 --> 01:44.380
watching you tormented

01:44.680 --> 01:47.540
by lovesickness day after day

01:48.070 --> 01:51.130
just warms my heart.

02:02.870 --> 02:04.020
Resentment

02:04.560 --> 02:08.450
is the world's best weapon.

02:12.840 --> 02:14.610
This is a drop of Bear Islanders' blood.

02:15.000 --> 02:16.540
Only Bear Islanders' blood

02:16.840 --> 02:19.170
can awaken the Pregenesis Sword.

02:19.590 --> 02:21.170
I want you to use a spell formation

02:21.190 --> 02:22.340
to control someone

02:23.190 --> 02:24.570
and borrow his strength

02:24.840 --> 02:28.540
to turn Bear Islanders' blood to mist.

02:28.560 --> 02:29.850
This jade talisman

02:30.560 --> 02:32.820
was left by Senior Wan.

02:36.520 --> 02:39.130
When the blood mist touches
the Pregenesis Sword,

02:40.960 --> 02:43.690
it'll absorb everyone's power.

02:51.420 --> 02:54.380
[Episode 20]

02:55.630 --> 02:58.570
You knew the rumors were about you,

02:58.840 --> 03:01.380
so you hid in Ascendance Sect.

03:01.710 --> 03:04.220
You also knew we were
after the Pregenesis Sword,

03:04.630 --> 03:05.820
so this sword

03:06.360 --> 03:08.610
must be hidden on you.

03:09.280 --> 03:10.570
You were careful.

03:11.000 --> 03:13.820
Every move was flawless.

03:15.680 --> 03:16.540
But

03:18.150 --> 03:20.730
that was your biggest weak spot.

03:36.560 --> 03:37.610
Were we a step too late?

03:41.150 --> 03:42.610
My magical power is fading.

03:42.750 --> 03:43.540
This feeling

03:44.000 --> 03:45.290
is just like when we were
at Bear Island.

03:48.340 --> 03:51.380
[Hall of Mortal Coils]

04:03.710 --> 04:04.340
Senior.

04:05.080 --> 04:05.980
Why is

04:06.520 --> 04:07.780
my power fading?

04:08.960 --> 04:10.780
Everyone, hold the line!

04:14.560 --> 04:16.050
Wipe out Ascendance Sect!

04:16.360 --> 04:17.250
Charge!

04:32.270 --> 04:33.540
Demon Army,

04:33.560 --> 04:35.020
surround the Hall of Mortal Coils!

04:35.040 --> 04:36.290
Let no one escape!

04:37.560 --> 04:38.340
That's...

04:59.040 --> 04:59.810
Senior,

04:59.870 --> 05:02.050
my power is truly gone!

05:02.070 --> 05:02.850
What do we do?

05:15.390 --> 05:16.930
Monster! Get away!

05:17.070 --> 05:17.900
Get away!

05:18.270 --> 05:19.730
Please?

05:22.600 --> 05:24.700
Get away! Get away!

05:24.800 --> 05:25.540
Xuanya,

05:25.630 --> 05:27.540
you are of noble birth.

05:28.000 --> 05:28.980
If you can,

05:29.630 --> 05:30.610
escape.

05:30.750 --> 05:32.290
I'm a disciple of Ascendance Sect.

05:33.040 --> 05:35.780
I stand with the sect.

05:42.240 --> 05:44.020
Mentor, I'm out of spiritual power.

05:44.680 --> 05:45.170
This...

05:46.800 --> 05:48.050
Their spiritual power is gone.

05:48.070 --> 05:48.780
He...

05:49.240 --> 05:50.020
What to do?

05:51.720 --> 05:52.490
Senior!

05:53.870 --> 05:54.660
Senior!

05:55.310 --> 05:56.100
Senior!

05:56.800 --> 05:58.020
All fellow disciples,

05:58.430 --> 05:59.170
draw your swords!

06:02.040 --> 06:03.100
Even if we die today,

06:03.510 --> 06:06.580
we must defend our sect to the last.

06:06.630 --> 06:08.050
Defend our sect to the last!

06:15.800 --> 06:16.580
Senior!

06:16.600 --> 06:17.730
Senior, please wake up.

06:19.430 --> 06:19.850
Senior!

06:20.040 --> 06:21.490
Senior, wake up. Please.

06:21.720 --> 06:22.700
Senior, look at me.

06:22.720 --> 06:23.610
Wake up.

06:25.830 --> 06:26.610
Senior.

06:27.950 --> 06:28.730
Senior.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.730
Senior! Senior!

06:39.430 --> 06:40.660
This foolish old man...

06:43.000 --> 06:43.930
It's Bear Islanders' blood.

06:44.600 --> 06:46.020
My mentor was made the formation core.

06:46.160 --> 06:48.170
Bear Islanders' blood woke up the Sword.

06:48.800 --> 06:49.700
I miscalculated.

06:49.750 --> 06:50.610
Little rascal, you...

06:50.630 --> 06:52.900
I never saw the formation
would drive the Sword.

06:52.950 --> 06:53.900
That was my oversight.

06:54.430 --> 06:55.410
This foolish old man

06:55.430 --> 06:58.020
hid the truth about Kuai Si from me.

06:59.720 --> 07:01.170
But now, I've found the core,

07:01.190 --> 07:02.540
so I can break the formation.

07:03.190 --> 07:04.370
Just give me more time.

07:06.190 --> 07:06.980
Little rascal.

07:07.830 --> 07:08.610
Li Changshou.

07:12.390 --> 07:13.220
Right now,

07:13.830 --> 07:14.980
you don't have to be so rational.

07:15.830 --> 07:17.020
It's okay to cry.

07:18.510 --> 07:19.100
You're human,

07:19.190 --> 07:19.900
not a deity.

07:20.630 --> 07:21.780
No need to control everything.

07:23.680 --> 07:24.340
Don't be afraid.

07:25.240 --> 07:26.410
I'm heading
to Ascendance Sect right now.

07:26.430 --> 07:27.660
When I arrive, everything will be fine.

07:27.680 --> 07:28.250
You mustn't!

07:28.270 --> 07:29.410
I ride the clouds.

07:29.750 --> 07:31.610
I'll be there in half a stick
of incense's time.

07:31.630 --> 07:32.370
Wait for me.

07:32.390 --> 07:33.220
Yunxiao, don't!

07:33.360 --> 07:34.020
Why?

07:34.600 --> 07:36.220
You're clearly at your wit's end.

07:38.190 --> 07:39.780
I have plenty of strategies.

07:40.360 --> 07:41.610
How could I be at my wit's end?

07:41.630 --> 07:42.290
Don't worry.

07:48.190 --> 07:49.900
You taught me to trust others.

07:51.600 --> 07:52.660
Don't you trust me?

07:53.800 --> 07:54.410
You are

07:54.950 --> 07:56.220
my last resort.

07:56.870 --> 07:57.730
You must not be exposed.

08:00.630 --> 08:02.460
Even if Seizing members
are being killed,

08:03.750 --> 08:04.730
I still can't help them?

08:06.950 --> 08:08.140
You've been lying to me.

08:09.360 --> 08:10.810
But I trusted you all this time.

08:12.190 --> 08:13.340
You said you had a plan.

08:13.630 --> 08:14.610
What plan?

08:14.630 --> 08:16.220
Can it save my Seizing fellows?

08:16.800 --> 08:17.580
Let me hear it.

08:21.240 --> 08:22.220
I'm sorry, Yunxiao.

08:25.160 --> 08:26.170
I thought

08:27.000 --> 08:29.220
I could solve all of this,

08:29.240 --> 08:30.610
repel the Demon Clan

08:30.630 --> 08:32.980
and restore Seizing cultivators.

08:33.270 --> 08:34.940
I thought I could save everyone.

08:37.150 --> 08:37.850
I'm sorry.

08:39.790 --> 08:41.610
If you'd listened to me from the start,

08:42.080 --> 08:43.340
taken the fight to Westdawn Sect,

08:44.240 --> 08:46.130
and even killed Kuai Si first,

08:47.240 --> 08:47.850
things

08:48.480 --> 08:49.850
wouldn't have come to this.

08:51.120 --> 08:52.300
You're always scheming,

08:52.750 --> 08:54.220
yet you keep losing more.

08:54.790 --> 08:56.610
Why is the Great Tribulation
drawing near?

08:59.150 --> 09:00.420
I'm heading to Ascendance Sect now.

09:00.670 --> 09:01.490
Yunxiao, you mustn't.

09:02.030 --> 09:02.730
Why?

09:02.750 --> 09:04.010
Because two pieces
of the Sword

09:04.030 --> 09:05.770
cannot be in the same place at once.

09:12.030 --> 09:14.180
We only split the Sword fragment
into three pieces

09:14.840 --> 09:15.770
to ensure

09:15.790 --> 09:17.490
no one could get this key

09:18.030 --> 09:19.250
and avert the Great Tribulation.

09:36.030 --> 09:36.820
So,

09:38.270 --> 09:40.980
from the moment
I got this Sword fragment,

09:43.080 --> 09:44.610
you had already decided

09:45.630 --> 09:47.060
never to see me again?

09:48.720 --> 09:49.730
It's not my decision.

09:51.840 --> 09:52.820
It's fate.

09:52.840 --> 09:54.460
But I have never believed in fate.

09:57.150 --> 09:57.940
Yunxiao,

09:59.200 --> 10:00.700
please, think calmly.

10:00.840 --> 10:02.610
You've been
under Westdawn Sect's control.

10:03.440 --> 10:05.300
Did you think
they wouldn't anticipate you?

10:06.840 --> 10:07.940
This is a trap.

10:08.630 --> 10:09.610
If you come,

10:09.840 --> 10:12.220
you'll simply become a puppet
like my mentor.

10:12.240 --> 10:13.610
What we must do now

10:13.630 --> 10:14.530
isn't how to rescue

10:14.550 --> 10:16.300
those controlled by the Demon Clan,

10:16.320 --> 10:18.820
but how to clear Seizing Sect's name

10:18.840 --> 10:20.180
and restore their innocence.

10:22.240 --> 10:23.730
Yunxiao, please think again.

10:30.080 --> 10:30.530
Alright.

10:33.600 --> 10:34.770
Even now,

10:36.390 --> 10:37.820
you're still thinking of me.

10:39.200 --> 10:40.820
What a selfless hero.

10:43.120 --> 10:44.460
This time, I'll do as you say.

10:45.320 --> 10:46.370
I won't come find you.

10:48.600 --> 10:50.580
But after today,
we needn't stay in touch.

10:51.360 --> 10:53.010
I'll follow my own heart from now on.

10:54.440 --> 10:56.060
I won't consult you on every matter.

10:57.630 --> 10:58.420
Farewell,

10:59.480 --> 11:00.420
Li Changshou.

11:10.760 --> 11:15.250
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

11:17.130 --> 11:23.620
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

11:25.510 --> 11:31.140
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

11:32.000 --> 11:39.020
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

11:41.030 --> 11:42.100
I'm sorry, Senior.

11:46.150 --> 11:48.010
Senior, you're finally back.

11:48.270 --> 11:49.980
Why can't we use our magical power?

11:50.000 --> 11:51.250
But those demons can.

11:51.670 --> 11:52.820
Because they are from the Demon Clan.

11:52.870 --> 11:53.980
They're immune to the Pregenesis Sword.

11:54.000 --> 11:54.700
What sword?

11:54.750 --> 11:56.060
I must leave here at once.

11:56.320 --> 11:58.250
You're trying to flee now?

11:59.480 --> 12:01.460
They weaken as they get close to me.

12:01.670 --> 12:02.460
Come with me.

12:03.720 --> 12:05.180
Only when the Three Sects join forces

12:05.910 --> 12:07.340
can there be hope.

12:11.030 --> 12:12.610
The Three Sects have to join forces.

12:15.750 --> 12:17.300
The Three Sects have to join forces.

12:17.720 --> 12:18.890
The Three Sects have to join forces?

12:20.750 --> 12:23.010
With Ascendance Sect alone,

12:23.910 --> 12:25.890
we can't weather this trial.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.010
Jiu Wu.

12:28.200 --> 12:29.130
Jiu Jiu.

12:30.630 --> 12:32.340
Save Ascendance Sect.

12:38.240 --> 12:39.460
I'm Jiu Wu

12:40.030 --> 12:40.610
at your command.

12:45.550 --> 12:46.650
I'm Jiu Jiu

12:47.200 --> 12:47.770
at your command.

13:09.030 --> 13:11.220
Fairy Yunxiao,
a gifted Seizing disciple.

13:12.000 --> 13:13.420
Why barge into Celestial Court?

13:13.440 --> 13:14.060
Looking for someone.

13:15.670 --> 13:16.490
Looking for someone?

13:17.150 --> 13:18.850
The Celestial Court has its rules.

13:18.870 --> 13:21.490
You can't come and go as you please.

13:21.840 --> 13:22.610
Is that so?

13:45.080 --> 13:45.890
Come in.

13:47.030 --> 13:49.700
Da, Er, I'm starving.

13:49.720 --> 13:51.010
I want some mutton soup.

13:53.240 --> 13:53.820
Hurry, hurry!

13:53.840 --> 13:54.770
Come out, come out!

13:55.480 --> 13:58.770
Are you that great deity?

13:59.910 --> 14:00.460
No.

14:01.080 --> 14:01.980
I'm also from the Sea Deity Sect.

14:02.030 --> 14:03.650
How come I don't recognize you?

14:12.550 --> 14:13.730
Ke Le'er!

14:13.750 --> 14:14.770
That's me.

14:14.790 --> 14:15.340
Quick, quick!

14:15.360 --> 14:16.060
What?

14:16.600 --> 14:17.010
Don't ask.

14:17.910 --> 14:19.420
Come out. Come out now!

14:29.870 --> 14:30.850
Ke Le'er.

14:31.750 --> 14:32.610
Ke Le'er.

14:33.390 --> 14:34.980
So good to see you.

14:35.480 --> 14:36.060
Ke Le'er.

14:36.080 --> 14:38.010
Ke Le'er, Ke Le'er.

14:38.440 --> 14:39.130
Ke Le'er.

14:39.150 --> 14:39.650
You all...

14:40.150 --> 14:42.100
You can leave?

14:42.480 --> 14:43.250
Right.

14:43.750 --> 14:45.580
Then why are you still here?

14:45.600 --> 14:47.180
No one told us to leave.

14:47.200 --> 14:48.100
Yes.

14:48.120 --> 14:48.420
Exactly.

14:48.440 --> 14:49.650
Can we go?

14:50.000 --> 14:51.010
Of course.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.770
You still need to save your people.

14:52.910 --> 14:54.370
Right, go quickly.

14:54.480 --> 14:55.250
Go, go.

14:55.750 --> 14:56.610
Hurry, go, go.

14:57.320 --> 14:57.850
Go now.

14:59.670 --> 15:01.300
Finally, they're gone. Let's go too.

15:01.320 --> 15:01.980
Wait.

15:02.480 --> 15:03.340
We can't take her.

15:03.840 --> 15:04.650
Why?

15:05.030 --> 15:06.180
You belong to the Seizing Sect.

15:06.440 --> 15:07.490
It's dangerous to take you.

15:09.030 --> 15:10.010
You suspect me?

15:10.600 --> 15:11.180
No.

15:11.200 --> 15:12.180
Then what do you mean?

15:12.630 --> 15:15.130
Breaking through means a death battle.

15:15.390 --> 15:16.820
When you see your mentor,

15:17.320 --> 15:18.420
could you strike him?

15:20.870 --> 15:22.060
If she can't do it,

15:22.870 --> 15:23.980
then she's a liability.

15:24.150 --> 15:24.610
Then...

15:25.240 --> 15:26.180
In that case,

15:27.270 --> 15:29.010
I won't go with you.

15:29.510 --> 15:30.340
Your Highness,

15:30.670 --> 15:32.220
the Pearl Elites are well-trained.

15:32.440 --> 15:34.220
Even without magical power,
they can fight.

15:34.440 --> 15:35.610
She's from the Seizing Sect.

15:35.720 --> 15:37.340
Without magical power, she's useless.

15:38.150 --> 15:39.650
The Pearl Elites can guard you.

15:40.030 --> 15:41.730
They are your safest choice.

15:42.030 --> 15:43.490
I know that, Si'er.

15:43.510 --> 15:45.250
Thank you for saving me.

15:45.440 --> 15:46.060
But

15:47.320 --> 15:48.580
I want to protect my senior.

15:50.630 --> 15:51.580
If that is your wish,

15:51.910 --> 15:54.060
then may you shine,

15:54.080 --> 15:55.060
break through the siege,

15:55.240 --> 15:56.130
and survive this trial.

15:56.240 --> 15:57.730
We shall meet again.

16:04.120 --> 16:05.220
Let us go too, Senior.

16:06.440 --> 16:07.250
Wait.

16:07.600 --> 16:08.610
Where is Cansheng?

16:15.510 --> 16:16.220
Cansheng...

16:24.200 --> 16:25.490
Why so many mosquitoes?

16:26.840 --> 16:27.820
Da, Er.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.010
Go, now!

16:29.320 --> 16:29.820
Hurry!

16:34.940 --> 16:38.270
[Subtle and Mystic]

16:38.270 --> 16:39.250
Guard all exits.

16:39.440 --> 16:40.420
Let no one escape.

16:40.840 --> 16:43.530
The Pregenesis Sword must be here.

16:49.270 --> 16:50.770
Changgeng.

17:01.030 --> 17:02.530
How's that? Not bad, right?

17:07.830 --> 17:09.330
I made such a big sacrifice this time.

17:09.350 --> 17:10.940
Senior must be very moved.

17:13.240 --> 17:14.010
Zhao Gongming.

17:15.640 --> 17:16.420
Zhao Gongming.

17:17.750 --> 17:18.530
Zhao Gongming.

17:20.030 --> 17:21.180
Zhao Gongming, come out!

17:23.720 --> 17:24.330
Zhao...

17:33.270 --> 17:34.050
I've never seen a temple like yours

17:34.070 --> 17:35.900
in Jade Division.

17:37.590 --> 17:38.420
No, just say what you want to say.

17:38.440 --> 17:39.460
Don't touch my money!

17:39.720 --> 17:40.620
Come out and help them.

17:42.830 --> 17:44.770
I'm scared.

17:45.480 --> 17:47.330
My power's faded. I can't win.

17:47.590 --> 17:49.220
Then how did you transform?

17:49.550 --> 17:50.570
My power worked when I transformed.

17:50.590 --> 17:51.220
Now, I lack the power

17:51.240 --> 17:52.860
to change back.

17:52.880 --> 17:53.090
I...

17:53.110 --> 17:53.900
5,000 spirit stones.

17:53.920 --> 17:54.620
Go.

18:00.160 --> 18:00.940
Hurry!

18:21.720 --> 18:23.250
Cansheng, what's wrong?

18:23.640 --> 18:24.330
Cansheng.

18:37.350 --> 18:38.010
Cansheng.

18:38.640 --> 18:39.010
Go.

18:52.920 --> 18:54.090
Why should I be curious?

18:54.110 --> 18:54.700
Likewise.

18:54.720 --> 18:55.530
I'm done talking to you.

18:55.720 --> 18:56.570
You're a bad man.

18:56.590 --> 18:57.900
I'll go back to the sect and report you.

18:57.920 --> 18:59.380
Changshou.

18:59.400 --> 19:01.810
Senior Yuan Qing scolds sweetly.

19:01.830 --> 19:02.980
It's okay if you move.

19:03.000 --> 19:04.010
It's already late.

19:04.160 --> 19:05.380
I don't care.

19:05.400 --> 19:07.250
Li Changshou!

19:16.400 --> 19:18.220
I must go save Cansheng.

19:18.550 --> 19:20.250
Cansheng's body is special; don't worry.

19:21.270 --> 19:22.620
Mentor has vanished.

19:22.640 --> 19:23.730
I can't leave Cansheng behind.

19:24.240 --> 19:25.010
Little Uncle,

19:25.350 --> 19:26.730
I treat you like my own brother.

19:26.750 --> 19:28.290
Then Cansheng is my brother too.

19:28.310 --> 19:29.570
I can't just leave him behind.

19:29.960 --> 19:31.010
I must keep him safe,

19:31.030 --> 19:32.420
just as I must keep you safe.

19:33.720 --> 19:35.090
Little Uncle, you go first.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.770
Then I'll bring Cansheng to you.

19:37.510 --> 19:39.010
Thanks for saying you'd protect me.

19:40.720 --> 19:42.460
But I'm Mentor Yuan Ze's first disciple.

19:44.350 --> 19:45.490
He's vanished.

19:47.070 --> 19:48.860
Only I can hold Turtle Island.

19:49.860 --> 19:53.240
♪At the cloud peak, with sun and moon♪

19:53.240 --> 19:55.380
I'll bring Cansheng back to see you.

19:55.380 --> 19:58.410
♪My heart is carved
with all living beings♪

19:59.320 --> 20:04.860
♪An unexpected meeting
in this Primordial World♪

20:07.400 --> 20:11.460
♪This lad, at first, is hard to admire♪

20:11.800 --> 20:16.310
♪In a flash, I recall our near misses♪

20:16.780 --> 20:23.960
♪Fearing inescapable karmic threads♪

20:25.240 --> 20:26.290
Little Uncle,

20:26.880 --> 20:28.530
I hope I can see you again.

20:29.980 --> 20:34.810
♪An edge hides, yet flows with ease♪

20:35.640 --> 20:40.640
♪Making me lean down and confirm slowly♪

20:40.640 --> 20:42.660
Cansheng, I'm coming to save you.

20:50.310 --> 20:51.180
Senior!

21:11.480 --> 21:12.530
Senior,

21:13.750 --> 21:15.180
I will protect you.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.010
Senior,

21:26.030 --> 21:27.490
I will save you!

21:52.640 --> 21:53.700
The Second Prince.

22:04.440 --> 22:04.980
This...

22:13.640 --> 22:14.420
How

22:16.030 --> 22:17.420
can there be a dragon?

22:23.030 --> 22:23.900
Little Uncle.

22:25.790 --> 22:26.660
Little Uncle.

22:30.750 --> 22:31.940
Little Uncle's clothes.

22:38.510 --> 22:39.660
Who let you in?

22:39.720 --> 22:40.770
This is Turtle Island.

22:40.790 --> 22:41.940
I go where I please.

22:45.270 --> 22:47.220
There are plenty
of pitiful people in this world.

22:47.680 --> 22:50.180
If all wallowed in self-pity like you,

22:50.200 --> 22:51.660
they would have died long ago.

22:56.310 --> 22:57.810
You are now one of Turtle Island.

22:57.830 --> 22:59.330
If anyone outside dares to bully you,

22:59.510 --> 23:01.770
I will stand up for you.

23:02.200 --> 23:03.180
You bold demoness!

23:03.200 --> 23:04.490
Don't bully Little Uncle!

23:05.000 --> 23:06.250
I want to protect my senior.

23:10.270 --> 23:11.250
Little Uncle.

23:16.110 --> 23:18.090
Senior, where are you?

23:23.200 --> 23:25.420
I will definitely avenge you.

23:32.920 --> 23:33.980
They didn't catch me.

23:52.480 --> 23:53.490
Don't kill me.

24:11.070 --> 24:11.730
Mentor.

24:14.680 --> 24:15.330
Mentor.

24:16.400 --> 24:18.180
Once I break the formation
and get my power back,

24:18.200 --> 24:19.220
we'll be safe again.

24:20.200 --> 24:21.770
Mentor, please hold on.

24:21.790 --> 24:23.180
I've found a way to break it.

24:23.550 --> 24:24.940
But it'll take an incense stick's time.

24:51.510 --> 24:52.420
Chaos Bell.

24:52.640 --> 24:53.420
What bell?

24:55.240 --> 24:56.220
You're not Changgeng.

24:57.440 --> 24:58.220
Who are you?

24:59.830 --> 25:01.420
I have to give my name before I die?

25:02.830 --> 25:04.420
I am Lan Ling'e of Jade Division.

25:05.030 --> 25:06.180
Lan Ling'e?

25:07.480 --> 25:08.090
No.

25:09.550 --> 25:10.660
You are not human.

25:11.920 --> 25:12.770
I am not human.

25:13.590 --> 25:15.250
Right, you're not human.

25:17.270 --> 25:17.770
Then...

25:17.790 --> 25:19.140
We've searched for you for years.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.090
So, you've been here all along.

25:21.960 --> 25:23.620
Looking for me?

25:25.480 --> 25:27.420
You don't know your origins?

25:27.920 --> 25:28.420
I...

25:28.920 --> 25:29.860
What origins?

25:30.030 --> 25:31.380
I have the Pregenesis Sword

25:32.110 --> 25:33.620
- you want.
- Changgeng.

25:39.920 --> 25:41.010
Leave, quickly.

25:41.030 --> 25:42.060
Don't let them catch you.

25:43.030 --> 25:44.180
Thank you so much.

25:46.480 --> 25:48.180
Kill Changgeng! Seize the Sword!

25:48.310 --> 25:49.930
My origins?

25:53.510 --> 25:54.620
What poor quality!

25:55.680 --> 25:56.010
Jerk!

25:56.030 --> 25:57.180
If not for my sister,

25:57.270 --> 25:58.660
5,000 spirit stones
would surely not be enough.

26:00.920 --> 26:01.700
Come at me!

26:14.830 --> 26:15.530
Coward!

26:15.960 --> 26:16.900
Come at me!

26:18.440 --> 26:20.290
Coward! Such a coward!

26:24.680 --> 26:25.420
They're all here?

26:26.480 --> 26:27.250
No.

26:27.920 --> 26:28.700
Help!

26:32.270 --> 26:33.140
It's a trap!

26:39.310 --> 26:40.380
You...

26:40.400 --> 26:43.730
You can break the Westdawn secret art?

27:01.880 --> 27:03.220
Li Changshou.

27:03.640 --> 27:04.860
Or perhaps

27:05.680 --> 27:08.730
I should call you Changgeng.

27:09.480 --> 27:10.940
Everyone, count heads, quickly!

27:10.960 --> 27:11.460
Over here, over here!

27:11.480 --> 27:14.180
Injured, to the Hall of Mortal Coils!

27:14.200 --> 27:14.460
Aunt.

27:14.480 --> 27:15.330
Ling'e.

27:15.350 --> 27:15.940
Aunt.

27:15.960 --> 27:16.090
Junior.

27:16.110 --> 27:16.770
Are you alright?

27:16.830 --> 27:17.940
I'm fine, I'm fine.

27:18.240 --> 27:19.140
Where is Senior Changshou?

27:19.160 --> 27:20.220
I can't find him.

27:20.480 --> 27:21.250
Where's Changshou?

27:21.400 --> 27:22.660
Senior Changshou is back
at Jade Division.

27:22.680 --> 27:23.570
He's breaking the formation.

27:24.070 --> 27:25.010
That fool.

27:25.240 --> 27:26.180
Off on his own at a time like this?

27:26.200 --> 27:26.860
Where are you heading?

27:26.880 --> 27:28.050
To find Changshou and help him.

27:28.070 --> 27:29.010
You're not going.

27:29.240 --> 27:29.770
Why?

27:29.790 --> 27:30.810
Because you're too restless.

27:30.830 --> 27:31.730
Because you can't stay calm.

27:31.880 --> 27:33.250
Because I'm worried about you!

27:38.790 --> 27:40.460
Didn't I tell you before?

27:40.680 --> 27:41.860
I have an agreement with Qi Yuan.

27:41.880 --> 27:42.460
I promised him

27:42.480 --> 27:44.380
to look after Jade disciples.

27:44.400 --> 27:44.660
I...

27:45.070 --> 27:46.660
A promise must be kept.

27:46.920 --> 27:48.010
This is my duty.

27:48.750 --> 27:49.250
I'll go.

27:49.720 --> 27:50.380
Bye.

27:51.510 --> 27:52.460
Senior, I will go with you.

27:53.400 --> 27:54.460
Stay here.

27:54.550 --> 27:55.420
Why on earth

27:55.440 --> 27:56.530
won't you let me go with you?

27:56.550 --> 27:57.460
You tell me.

27:57.480 --> 27:58.730
Why did I punish you
on behalf of Mentor?

27:58.750 --> 27:59.460
Have you forgotten?

28:05.920 --> 28:08.220
Jiu, stay here.

28:09.030 --> 28:10.140
Protect Mentor.

28:11.000 --> 28:12.180
Protect the Hall of Mortal Coils.

28:13.270 --> 28:14.380
That is your duty.

28:20.160 --> 28:21.420
Do you hear me?

28:24.440 --> 28:25.330
Listen to me.

28:25.640 --> 28:27.770
This time, do not let Mentor or me

28:27.790 --> 28:28.770
be disappointed in you.

28:36.830 --> 28:37.700
Take care, Senior.

28:37.720 --> 28:38.810
Stay safe on the road.

28:39.270 --> 28:40.290
That's more like it.

28:40.310 --> 28:41.050
I'm off.

28:42.590 --> 28:43.250
But...

28:43.640 --> 28:44.900
The key to this crisis

28:45.030 --> 28:47.250
is this formation that drains power.

28:47.830 --> 28:48.730
As long as power returns,

28:48.750 --> 28:50.090
the danger will pass.

28:51.240 --> 28:52.330
Then what should we do?

28:52.400 --> 28:53.330
There are two ways.

28:53.830 --> 28:55.730
First, break the formation.

28:55.750 --> 28:56.220
Second,

28:56.590 --> 28:58.980
get rid of the magic instrument
driving this formation.

28:59.880 --> 29:00.660
Remember this:

29:01.400 --> 29:03.050
Once safe, find Jiu Jiu

29:03.200 --> 29:04.090
and have her come to me.

29:04.110 --> 29:05.090
Aunt Jiu Jiu?

29:05.110 --> 29:05.900
That's right.

29:05.920 --> 29:07.620
She's our sect's top swordswoman.

29:07.720 --> 29:09.140
When magical power is gone,

29:09.480 --> 29:10.660
she's the strongest fighter.

29:11.270 --> 29:12.420
And easiest to fool.

29:13.240 --> 29:14.460
Why say it so bluntly?

29:15.880 --> 29:17.770
I suppose Uncle Jiu Wu is okay?

29:18.750 --> 29:19.900
Sorry, Senior.

29:25.070 --> 29:25.860
It's over.

29:27.440 --> 29:28.420
I botched it.

29:41.680 --> 29:42.730
Changgeng,

29:43.240 --> 29:44.290
keep running.

29:45.640 --> 29:48.010
We finally meet.

29:52.590 --> 29:53.380
What?

29:55.680 --> 29:57.050
Have we not met before?

29:57.880 --> 29:59.460
I've long heard of your name.

30:00.480 --> 30:01.420
Meeting you

30:02.270 --> 30:03.460
is a first for me.

30:08.000 --> 30:09.010
That's good then.

30:13.790 --> 30:15.700
You went through trouble to find me.

30:18.790 --> 30:19.900
Of course.

30:20.750 --> 30:22.090
Because only then

30:22.440 --> 30:24.660
can I kill you.

30:29.440 --> 30:30.660
But more importantly,

30:31.070 --> 30:31.860
it's to let Seizing Sect take the blame

30:31.880 --> 30:34.530
for Ascendance Sect's massacre,

30:34.960 --> 30:37.620
and trigger war among the Three Sects

30:37.920 --> 30:40.250
to turn you against each other.

30:42.880 --> 30:43.660
It's you.

30:46.510 --> 30:47.860
You made the Seizing Sect

30:49.640 --> 30:50.940
shoulder this infamy.

30:51.590 --> 30:53.050
All these years,

30:53.270 --> 30:55.490
you've been Westdawn's mole

30:55.880 --> 30:57.090
in Ascendance.

30:57.110 --> 30:57.900
Wrong.

30:58.200 --> 31:00.770
Westdawn didn't make me a mole.

31:00.790 --> 31:04.250
I used Westdawn
to strengthen Ascendance.

31:05.480 --> 31:06.900
Strengthen Ascendance?

31:08.070 --> 31:09.730
Westdawn attacked us,

31:09.750 --> 31:11.460
killed many of our disciples,

31:11.480 --> 31:13.010
and took my mentor
as the formation core.

31:13.030 --> 31:14.980
That's strengthening Ascendance?

31:17.510 --> 31:19.460
Without destruction, no creation.

31:20.200 --> 31:22.660
Ascendance under Detached Master

31:23.350 --> 31:25.250
is hopeless.

31:25.400 --> 31:26.860
Only I

31:26.880 --> 31:28.940
can lead Ascendance

31:28.960 --> 31:31.380
and dominate the Three Realms.

31:36.640 --> 31:38.570
You're truly hopeless.

31:39.830 --> 31:40.980
So,

31:41.000 --> 31:42.860
you killed Seizing cultivators

31:42.880 --> 31:44.460
and tarnished the sect's name

31:45.880 --> 31:47.460
just to make them

31:48.680 --> 31:49.860
your scapegoats.

31:49.960 --> 31:51.460
Anyway, the Seizing Sect's reputation

31:51.480 --> 31:53.250
is already rotten.

31:55.070 --> 31:56.250
A little more won't matter.

31:56.830 --> 31:57.620
Right.

31:58.750 --> 31:59.730
The Seizing Sect

32:00.720 --> 32:01.860
is despised by all.

32:04.030 --> 32:05.620
This ragtag bunch

32:05.640 --> 32:07.460
consists of misfits and mongrels.

32:07.550 --> 32:09.050
They're heartless.

32:09.070 --> 32:10.420
I'm sick of them.

32:17.350 --> 32:19.490
But they're living beings, aren't they?

32:20.680 --> 32:22.180
They must have feelings.

32:25.510 --> 32:27.050
Then, do you think

32:28.680 --> 32:30.860
they'd grieve over a fellow's death?

32:33.270 --> 32:34.810
What is that to me?

32:35.140 --> 32:36.070
[Steady]

32:36.070 --> 32:37.420
I'll ask you one last time.

32:37.720 --> 32:39.180
Did you lead the Demon Clan here,

32:39.200 --> 32:40.980
use demonic arts on my mentor,

32:41.000 --> 32:42.730
and set up

32:42.750 --> 32:43.660
this power-draining formation?

32:43.790 --> 32:45.250
Not only that.

32:47.350 --> 32:49.010
I also ruined Qi Yuan's foundation,

32:49.440 --> 32:51.570
used Gnatsting Needle

32:51.590 --> 32:54.250
on our fellows,

32:54.270 --> 32:54.980
used Westdawn Sect

32:55.000 --> 32:57.530
for my Aureate Immortal Tribulation,

32:57.750 --> 32:58.570
and expelled all elders

32:59.720 --> 33:02.050
who opposed me.

33:03.160 --> 33:04.250
Elder Kuai.

33:06.480 --> 33:07.250
It was you?

33:08.960 --> 33:10.460
Why isn't it Jiu Jiu?

33:15.030 --> 33:15.730
Junior.

33:16.270 --> 33:16.980
Junior.

33:19.000 --> 33:20.010
If it were Jiu Jiu,

33:20.030 --> 33:22.050
her sword could've held
an incense stick's time.

33:22.480 --> 33:23.660
But Uncle Jiu Wu...

33:25.310 --> 33:27.530
You're buying time.

33:28.110 --> 33:28.810
Elder Kuai,

33:30.200 --> 33:31.050
I never expected

33:31.720 --> 33:33.730
you were behind this plot.

33:34.200 --> 33:36.010
Uncle, buy me some time.

33:36.030 --> 33:37.050
I'll save Mentor first.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.250
Jiu Wu,

33:44.070 --> 33:46.250
though you're
Detached Master's disciple,

33:47.160 --> 33:50.050
you've run the sect for years.

33:50.480 --> 33:51.660
I know

33:52.000 --> 33:54.180
you're slick and worldly.

33:57.070 --> 33:59.090
Everyone likes you.

33:59.750 --> 34:02.010
All are willing to heed you.

34:03.000 --> 34:03.770
You're

34:05.270 --> 34:06.460
a real talent.

34:07.350 --> 34:09.090
If you'd follow me,

34:09.710 --> 34:10.820
from now on,

34:11.630 --> 34:13.170
my trust in you

34:15.760 --> 34:19.380
will far surpass that
of Detached Master.

34:23.110 --> 34:24.490
Are you willing?

34:34.030 --> 34:35.010
It's too late.

34:37.190 --> 34:38.740
Why do they keep multiplying?

34:47.960 --> 34:48.740
Our sect

34:49.280 --> 34:50.650
has no traitor like you!

35:05.110 --> 35:06.490
What a pity.

35:13.030 --> 35:13.490
Uncle!

35:20.360 --> 35:22.610
I am an Aureate Immortal.

35:23.190 --> 35:26.860
A mere sword cannot harm me.

35:26.880 --> 35:28.650
Changshou, back to the Hall
of Mortal Coils!

35:29.030 --> 35:29.940
Uncle, you mustn't!

35:30.070 --> 35:31.570
Now, we're all low on magic arts.

35:31.880 --> 35:33.010
He's not that much stronger.

35:33.110 --> 35:33.900
Is that so?

35:35.070 --> 35:37.800
♪Once a drifting weed, I loved to roam♪

35:38.140 --> 35:40.260
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

35:40.570 --> 35:43.700
♪Fight against fate for my life♪

35:43.700 --> 35:46.550
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

35:47.550 --> 35:48.340
Uncle.

35:48.920 --> 35:50.170
He's using demonic arts now.

35:50.190 --> 35:51.170
We can't beat him.

35:51.400 --> 35:52.170
I'll take you away.

35:52.280 --> 35:53.260
Changshou, listen to me.

35:53.670 --> 35:55.050
I promised your mentor.

35:55.280 --> 35:56.570
I must see it through.

35:56.880 --> 35:57.650
Go!

35:57.650 --> 36:03.440
♪Though millions block, it echoes loud♪

36:05.800 --> 36:06.610
Uncle, wait for me.

36:09.020 --> 36:09.660
♪Plain and unremarkable♪

36:09.660 --> 36:10.620
♪From the start, plan for storms♪

36:10.620 --> 36:11.810
♪Seek refuge, survive, hide my skill♪

36:12.070 --> 36:13.530
Two ways to break this formation:

36:14.030 --> 36:15.300
Either break the formation,

36:16.280 --> 36:18.340
or discard the artifact that powers it.

36:18.720 --> 36:19.970
♪The evil knows no shame♪

36:19.970 --> 36:21.310
♪Immortal trials burn cowardice away♪

36:21.310 --> 36:22.520
♪The howling wind calls to me♪

36:22.520 --> 36:23.900
♪Gouging eyes to light the night
and ferry souls♪

36:23.900 --> 36:25.360
♪My soul is standing like a mountain♪

36:25.560 --> 36:27.120
♪Arrows in flesh as the string♪

36:27.230 --> 36:28.780
Your Highness.

36:28.780 --> 36:30.750
♪Standing tall, heart hides its might♪

36:30.750 --> 36:32.990
♪Today my name reaches heaven♪

36:32.990 --> 36:33.920
♪Actually, I've descended to the world♪

36:33.920 --> 36:35.380
The golden dragon is your true form.

36:35.960 --> 36:37.300
Once your transformation succeeds,

36:37.440 --> 36:39.300
the Pregenesis Sword
won't take effect on you.

36:41.550 --> 36:42.780
I know you wish to save them.

36:42.840 --> 36:44.260
But you don't know how, right?

36:45.070 --> 36:46.170
I wish to save them too.

36:46.630 --> 36:47.820
But you must help me.

36:47.860 --> 36:49.010
♪Charging against the wind♪

36:49.010 --> 36:50.430
♪Old scars reveal the truth♪

36:50.430 --> 36:51.240
♪Even if all brave men fall♪

36:51.240 --> 36:52.490
♪Chugging the murky wine♪

36:52.490 --> 36:54.870
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

36:56.760 --> 36:58.530
We've been in the same sect for years.

36:59.230 --> 37:02.050
I really can't bear to kill you.

37:02.880 --> 37:04.650
Knowing you'll lose,

37:06.000 --> 37:08.420
why court your destruction?

37:11.460 --> 37:15.160
♪From primal chaos♪

37:15.160 --> 37:19.520
♪To the starry sky♪

37:19.520 --> 37:23.100
♪In the whole world♪

37:23.100 --> 37:24.190
♪We shall hold the balance♪

37:24.190 --> 37:25.610
Junior Qi Yuan,

37:26.030 --> 37:27.130
this time,

37:27.590 --> 37:29.690
you've landed me in deep trouble.

37:32.800 --> 37:34.780
Traitor, face death!

37:43.840 --> 37:45.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

37:45.940 --> 37:49.900
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

37:51.720 --> 37:53.870
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

37:56.320 --> 37:57.090
Get away.

37:57.110 --> 37:57.860
Get away.

38:13.190 --> 38:14.650
Thank you for your help.

38:15.110 --> 38:17.260
May I ask your name?

38:17.510 --> 38:19.210
I'm a nameless disciple
from Ascendance Sect.

38:21.480 --> 38:22.650
You came on a dragon.

38:22.670 --> 38:24.690
How could you be a nameless disciple?

38:27.110 --> 38:28.420
You are Changgeng?

38:30.480 --> 38:31.820
Changgeng sent me.

38:32.630 --> 38:33.530
He sent you?

38:33.630 --> 38:35.260
Changgeng has a plan to win.

38:35.320 --> 38:36.170
Please come with me.

38:36.190 --> 38:36.820
I am not going.

38:37.320 --> 38:38.490
I have not said where yet.

38:38.510 --> 38:39.420
I am not going anywhere.

38:39.440 --> 38:41.420
It's Seizing vs Human. What's it to me?

38:41.440 --> 38:42.260
You're truly not going?

38:42.280 --> 38:43.260
Absolutely not.

38:43.920 --> 38:44.460
Will you go or not?

38:44.480 --> 38:45.170
What are you doing?

38:45.480 --> 38:47.610
Quick! Pull me up!

38:47.630 --> 38:48.820
Pull me up!

38:49.280 --> 38:50.130
I am warning you.

38:50.150 --> 38:51.260
Will you go or not?

38:51.440 --> 38:52.980
How dare you threaten me?

38:53.320 --> 38:54.170
Will you go or not?

38:54.760 --> 38:55.530
How dare you threaten me?

38:55.550 --> 38:56.570
This is no threat.

38:56.920 --> 38:58.980
It's a request to forces
against this crisis.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.260
Joining forces?

39:00.710 --> 39:02.170
What jest is this?

39:03.030 --> 39:03.980
See for yourself.

39:04.150 --> 39:05.460
Those Seizing disciples below

39:05.670 --> 39:07.300
are all bound by demonic arts.

39:07.670 --> 39:08.490
With your Aureate Immortal power,

39:08.510 --> 39:09.610
can't you even see that?

39:09.840 --> 39:11.050
Of course, I can see it.

39:11.070 --> 39:12.380
Today, it's Seizing vs Human.

39:12.760 --> 39:13.460
How about tomorrow?

39:14.070 --> 39:15.460
Elucidating vs Seizing?

39:15.630 --> 39:16.940
Human vs Elucidating?

39:17.400 --> 39:18.530
If this keeps going,

39:18.960 --> 39:21.420
is that your mentor's Way?

39:21.920 --> 39:22.210
You...

39:22.960 --> 39:23.490
You...

39:23.590 --> 39:24.860
A force has now arisen.

39:25.280 --> 39:26.690
They're the Three Sects' common foe.

39:27.000 --> 39:29.260
They want the Three Sects
to fight each other.

39:29.550 --> 39:31.690
Must you regret standing idly by

39:31.760 --> 39:33.900
after the enemy bares its fangs?

39:33.920 --> 39:34.530
And Changgeng...

39:35.070 --> 39:36.820
What does Changgeng really want?

39:42.840 --> 39:43.980
He wants to learn to trust.

40:33.450 --> 40:39.230
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

40:39.900 --> 40:46.600
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

40:48.130 --> 40:54.180
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

40:54.810 --> 41:01.260
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

41:02.000 --> 41:09.120
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

41:09.500 --> 41:16.400
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

41:16.780 --> 41:24.130
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

41:24.130 --> 41:31.300
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

41:47.440 --> 41:52.610
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

41:53.700 --> 42:00.720
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

42:01.910 --> 42:07.850
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

42:08.550 --> 42:15.630
♪Alas, our story is short♪

42:15.970 --> 42:23.080
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:23.400 --> 42:29.880
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:30.660 --> 42:37.870
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

